    },
    {
      "post_id": "552816072823693312",
      "text": "@smithmeyerjen @Colvinius I fail to see how the LNP impacts on the slaughter of 10 journalists and 2 police officers in Paris. Get a grip.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:16:37 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528156518242304e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552808931706155008",
      "text": "@Colvinius Just coz I show respect does not mean I back down.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:48:14 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528084948819804e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552815651824230400",
      "text": "Sorry @TheVoon &amp; @Colvinius NO disrespect intended. I want to respect journos even more but current LNP political climate makes it difficult",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:14:56 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5281427036348416e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552809825801752577",
      "text": "@smithmeyerjen Do what you like. You insulted me, you apologised. Your q was meaningless. No evidence redundancies had any political bent.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:51:47 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52808931706155e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552807857712664576",
      "text": "@mackaysuzie @Colvinius What makes you think it wasn't already before rabid @TonyAbbottMHR intimidation of ABC journos?",
