      "parent_id": 5.528072079436718e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552809506032197632",
      "text": "@rwerkh @ABCnewsIntern I didn't specify 'them'. See my TL: clear that Charlie Hebdo attacks everyone regardless of faith or politics.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:50:31 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528087040938721e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552814166528888833",
      "text": "@Colvinius Odd assumption @smithmeyerjen Listening to Mark is a pleasure. Totally balanced always. Perfect example of investigative Journo.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:09:02 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528098258017526e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552809897037819904",
      "text": "@Colvinius The other ABC identity I am angry about losing is Sarah Ferguson from 7.30. An astute, no pretence journo. We need more like her.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:52:04 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528084948819804e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552808704093872130",
      "text": "@colvinius Yes sure but let's establish who 'them' are. @abcnewsintern",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:47:20 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52805175874687e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552806178481115138",
      "text": "@Colvinius Hi, can you explain why some ABC journos have lost their jobs &amp; not others. The stayers make me doubt their integrity as pro-LNP!",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:37:18 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52805175874687e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552807523984478210",
      "text": "@smithmeyerjen @Colvinius That's an odd assumption. Journos who don't lose their job are LNP shills with no integrity?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:42:39 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5280617848111514e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552810892077719552",
      "text": "@colvinius Wasn't disagreeing with your point. Just conscious of need to lay blame only where due. @abcnewsintern",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:56:02 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528095060321976e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552810034413834240",
      "text": "@colvinius Yes. I am saying we need to properly identify those who didn't take the joke and argue specifically against them. @abcnewsintern",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:52:37 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528095060321976e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552807185051156480",
      "text": "@Colvinius Not meant that way but why some &amp; not others? For the record, I respect your work.",
